{"name":"Y2K","description":"Y2K 是一种重新演绎千禧年前后数字文化的复古视觉风格 · 它常用金属银、半透明塑料、糖果色和圆润轮廓，适合音乐、时尚和主题活动页面。这些元素用来表达年代感，不是一套必须照抄的颜色与圆角公式。","quote":"千禧年那种复古未来感：金属色、泡泡糖色、半透明塑料。","agentPrompt":"","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-style-y2k\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>Y2K</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">千禧年那种复古未来感：金属色、泡泡糖色、半透明塑料。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Y2K 是一种重新演绎千禧年前后数字文化的复古视觉风格</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>它常用金属银、半透明塑料、糖果色和圆润轮廓，适合音乐、时尚和主题活动页面。这些元素用来表达年代感，不是一套必须照抄的颜色与圆角公式。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>Y2K 千禧风</em><em>千禧风</em></div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"dh-demo style-detail-demo\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"风格示例，可横向滚动\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"style-detail-canvas\"><div class=\"style-y2k-demo style-y2k-profile\"><i class=\"style-y2k-star\" style=\"top:12px;left:8%;font-size:15px\">✦</i><i class=\"style-y2k-star\" style=\"bottom:12px;right:8%;font-size:14px\">✧</i><div class=\"y2k-browser\"><b>myspace.exe</b><span>home · diary · mix</span><i>ONLINE ♡</i></div><div class=\"y2k-main\"><section class=\"y2k-person\"><div class=\"y2k-avatar\">LU</div><b>lulu_2000</b><span>shanghai · 7,872 friends</span><button>+ add friend</button></section><section class=\"y2k-player\"><small>NOW PLAYING</small><b>plastic hearts</b><span>〈 THE SATURDAYS 〉</span><div class=\"y2k-progress\"><i></i></div><div class=\"y2k-controls\">◀　 <strong>▶</strong>　 ▶</div></section><aside class=\"y2k-guest\"><b>GUESTBOOK</b><span>momo: ur playlist is ☆</span><span>nana: call me later!</span><em>sign my book →</em></aside></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"principles-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">设计原则 · Principles</div><div class=\"usage-box use principles-box\"><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">金属渐变适合短标题和装饰，不用于大段正文</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选择一组带年代感的主色，并为每种颜色分配职责</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">圆润轮廓可以用于按钮和卡片，但要跟随组件尺寸</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">透明塑料和高光材质只在需要强调的区域使用</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">星形与闪片作为点缀，不能遮挡内容和操作</div></li></ul></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">时尚、美妆和潮流主题，需要复古数码感</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#ffd9ef,#bfe3ff);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;font-style:italic;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(150,110,200,.6)\">♡ 甜心潮牌 · 千禧复刻系列上新</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a7fb0;margin-top:4px\">适合品牌需要复古数码与玩乐感时</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">音乐播放器和应援页面，强调玩乐氛围</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#c9ecff,#ffd9ef);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3d6fa8\">♪ 偶像应援站 · 新单应援色冰蓝</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a7fb0;margin-top:4px\">播放器皮肤、应援页都适合</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">个人主页和博客皮肤，表达个人偏好</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">✦ 欢迎来到我的主页 ✦ 留言板 · 相册 · 背景音乐</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">个人主页可用它表达兴趣和身份</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">联名和快闪活动，使用短周期强主题</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">联名限定 · 复古千禧快闪店,只开 7 天</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">短周期活动页可使用更鲜明的主题表达</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">政务和金融核心任务中过度使用装饰</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><i class=\"ti ti-building-bank style-ti\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> 公积金查询页使用粉色泡泡和闪片</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">政务与金融页面应优先建立清楚、可信的表达</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">整段正文使用金属渐变，降低可读性</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c7d3e3,#67768c);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent\">正文整段做成金属渐变,反光晃眼看不清</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">整页高饱和且没有留白，造成视觉疲劳</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"width:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f556a8,#3d9fe8,#fbf236,#f556a8);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#fff\">整页高饱和渐变</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">与另一套商务风格并列使用，却没有统一规则</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:2px;background:#1f2937;color:#fff\">极简商务</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">+</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffc9e5,#f556a8);color:#fff\">Y2K 泡泡</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">发展历程 · History</div><div class=\"history-rail\"><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">1998</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>iMac G3 彩色透明壳</b><p>iMac G3 采用邦迪蓝等半透明外壳，让彩色塑料成为当时消费电子中具有辨识度的材料语言。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">1999</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>千禧年前夜</b><p>围绕千年虫和未来生活的文化讨论，使科技、未来与流行视觉在这一时期频繁交织。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2000-2004</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>流行文化中的扩散</b><p>流行音乐、即时通信与消费电子中常见金属、泡泡粉和闪片等元素，形成了今天常被归入 Y2K 的视觉记忆。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2007-2015</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>主流数字界面趋向简化</b><p>iPhone 与扁平化设计兴起后，许多数字产品减少了 glossy 质感；Y2K 元素仍在时尚、音乐和亚文化中持续出现。</p></div></div><div class=\"history-item\"><span class=\"hi-year\">2020s</span><div class=\"hi-body\"><b>复古语汇再被采用</b><p>一些年轻品牌、潮流和美妆视觉重新使用 Y2K 元素，并将其与当代排版和媒介结合。</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"style-y2k-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"chrome\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:#eaf2fb\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;font-style:italic;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#feffff 0%,#c7d3e3 32%,#67768c 49%,#eef4fb 55%,#f7fbff 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent\">铬字</span></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pink\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ffd9ef 50%,#bfe3ff 50%)\"></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"bubble\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffc9e5,#f556a8);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 2px rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">泡泡</span></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"gloss\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c9ecff,#3d9fe8);position:relative\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:4px;left:10px;right:10px;height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.95),rgba(255,255,255,0))\"></span></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"star\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ffd9ef,#bfe3ff);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,158,214,.95);font-size:15px\">✦</span></span>\n    </span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"chrome\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">金属铬渐变</span><span class=\"pe\">Chrome</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可用银灰渐变和 background-clip: text 模拟金属感，优先放在短标题</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"pink\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">年代配色</span><span class=\"pe\">Color</span></button><span class=\"pd\">示例使用粉与冰蓝；实际配色要结合品牌、对比度和内容层级</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"bubble\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">气泡圆角</span><span class=\"pe\">Bubble Shape</span></button><span class=\"pd\">胶囊形和大圆角能带来塑料气泡感，半径按组件尺寸调整</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"gloss\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">塑料高光</span><span class=\"pe\">Gloss</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用局部浅色高光提示透明或光滑材质，不能影响文字和边界</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"star\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">星星闪片</span><span class=\"pe\">Sparkles</span></button><span class=\"pd\">小型星形装饰可放在留白处，为页面增加节奏但不遮挡内容</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"prompt